      ],
      "kind": "linked_prose",
      "text": "Hard Khorium Goggles (Engineering) and Crown of Dath'Remar are both excellent mitigation helmets. The goggles have a bit of threat value in the form of hit rating that is very welcomed for a balanced gear set, since SWP gear has very few Hit Rating options. The crown, on the other hand, is purely mitigation-focused and perfect against Brutallus in particular, paired with the niche Eternal Earthstorm Diamond ."
    },
    {
      "gem_ids": [
        35501
      ],
      "gems": [
        {
          "item_id": 35501,
          "name": "Eternal Earthstorm Diamond"
        }
      ],
      "kind": "linked_prose",
      "text": "Sword Breaker's Bulwark is a small threat and mitigation upgrade to the Bulwark, which, you may have noticed, procs very rarely, all things considered. The increased shield block value pairs especially well with the Eternal Earthstorm Diamond in a special Brutallus set."
